{
  "declaredLength": 6980,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’ve been over this! <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Poison<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> is the best status\ncondition, hands down!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It chips away at your opponent’s HP, which is\nOBVIOUSLY the smartest way to win!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, I couldn’t agree less! <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Paralysis<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> puts all other\nstatus conditions to shame in my book!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Paralyzed opponents have to deal with a nasty\ndrop to their movement speed, you know.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pummeling them while they’re slow, then seizing\nan elegant victory—that’s the way to do it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You there, random passerby! You came at the\nperfect time.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000740068006500720065002C002000720061006E0064006F006D002000700061007300730065007200620079002100200059006F0075002000630061006D00650020006100740020007400680065000A0070006500720066006500630074002000740069006D0065002E001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Help us settle something, would you? We’re\ntrying to decide if poison or paralysis is better.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That means facing us in Pokémon battles—\nstarting with me! What do you say?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Help us settle whether poison or paralysis is\nbetter, would you?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480065006C007000200075007300200073006500740074006C00650020007700680065007400680065007200200070006F00690073006F006E0020006F007200200070006100720061006C0079007300690073002000690073000A006200650074007400650072002C00200077006F0075006C006400200079006F0075003F001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "First, you’ll face my team and their perilously\nparalyzing moves! Shall we, then?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We shall!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700650020007300680061006C006C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We shan’t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700650020007300680061006E201900740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well! I didn’t think you’d be paralyzed by fear\nbefore we even got started!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Paralyzed Pokémon suffer a significant drop in\ntheir movement speed.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006100720061006C0079007A0065006400200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020007300750066006600650072002000610020007300690067006E00690066006900630061006E0074002000640072006F007000200069006E000A007400680065006900720020006D006F00760065006D0065006E0074002000730070006500650064002E001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll go all-out on offense while your Pokémon are\nsitting ducks!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C00200067006F00200061006C006C002D006F007500740020006F006E0020006F006600660065006E007300650020007700680069006C006500200079006F0075007200200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020006100720065000A00730069007400740069006E00670020006400750063006B00730021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Poison may be first among the status conditions,\nbut I don’t mind battling you second.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You defeated me soundly...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020006400650066006500610074006500640020006D006500200073006F0075006E0064006C0079002E002E002E001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! But do be careful—paralysis lingers even after\na battle ends, you know!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If any of your Pokémon are paralyzed, be sure to\ncure them using Paralyze Heals.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So you held your own against Lyse’s paralyzing\nmoves, did you? Not bad at all...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But your next opponent is me! My powerful\npoison will sap your Pokémon’s HP dry!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Next up is poison! You ready to battle?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00650078007400200075007000200069007300200070006F00690073006F006E002100200059006F007500200072006500610064007900200074006F00200062006100740074006C0065003F001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ready as I’ll ever be!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065006100640079002000610073002000492019006C006C0020006500760065007200200062006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not right now",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00740020007200690067006800740020006E006F00770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Suddenly developed a healthy fear of poison,\nhave we?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530075006400640065006E006C007900200064006500760065006C006F007000650064002000610020006800650061006C007400680079002000660065006100720020006F006600200070006F00690073006F006E002C000A0068006100760065002000770065003F001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pokémon that have been poisoned take damage\nover and over again.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200074006800610074002000680061007600650020006200650065006E00200070006F00690073006F006E00650064002000740061006B0065002000640061006D006100670065000A006F00760065007200200061006E00640020006F00760065007200200061006700610069006E002E001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Soon you’ll see how terrifying that can be!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F006F006E00200079006F00752019006C006C002000730065006500200068006F0077002000740065007200720069006600790069006E006700200074006800610074002000630061006E0020006200650021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If your Pokémon are paralyzed, remember that\nParalyze Heals will cure them right up!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\"",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00220000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I wasn’t surprised when Lyse lost her battle, but I\ndidn’t think I’d lose too!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well. You’ve faced us both, so answer honestly.\nWhich status condition was tougher to beat?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Paralysis",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006100720061006C00790073006900730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Poison",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F00690073006F006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Neither of ’em!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E0065006900740068006500720020006F0066002020190065006D00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074003F0021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I knew it! You barely held your own against my\nparalyzing tactics!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006B006E00650077002000690074002100200059006F007500200062006100720065006C0079002000680065006C006400200079006F007500720020006F0077006E00200061006700610069006E007300740020006D0079000A0070006100720061006C0079007A0069006E0067002000740061006300740069006300730021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "R-really? I mean, er, duh!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 4956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052002D007200650061006C006C0079003F002000490020006D00650061006E002C002000650072002C00200064007500680021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rubbish! There’s no metric by which paralysis is\ninferior!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520075006200620069007300680021002000540068006500720065201900730020006E006F0020006D0065007400720069006300200062007900200077006800690063006800200070006100720061006C0079007300690073002000690073000A0069006E0066006500720069006F00720021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C-come again?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043002D0063006F006D006500200061006700610069006E003F0021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you saying you’re not bothered by status\nconditions in the slightest?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...Though I suppose it’s true that neither of us\nmanaged to win.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E00540068006F0075006700680020004900200073007500700070006F007300650020006900742019007300200074007200750065002000740068006100740020006E0065006900740068006500720020006F0066002000750073000A006D0061006E006100670065006400200074006F002000770069006E002E001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Looks like we both have a ways to go, huh?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F006F006B00730020006C0069006B006500200077006500200062006F0074006800200068006100760065002000610020007700610079007300200074006F00200067006F002C0020006800750068003F001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There are so many status conditions out there,\nand I want to master them all!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 5584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, and don’t think we’ve forgotten about your\nPokémon, either.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIf one of them still has a status condition from\nearlier, please use this Full Heal to cure it.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 5748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 167
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That particular item can cure any and all status\nconditions. We always keep a healthy supply.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Remember—status conditions should be cured as\nsoon as possible.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt’s not nice to make your Pokémon put up with\nthe discomfort for long!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s my advice for you, fellow Trainer.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800610074201900730020006D0079002000610064007600690063006500200066006F007200200079006F0075002C002000660065006C006C006F007700200054007200610069006E00650072002E001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
